// Formerly reject/E-BRIDGE-CAP/would-unlowered-form.ron: the would-matcher
// lowered only the three intent shapes the engine emitted. Under
// engine-one-evaluator every intercepted intent presents its fact record —
// a `SpellCast` intent evaluates a `Cast` would-pattern ([CR#601.2i,614]),
// so the row lifted and the fixture flipped to the admitted side.
Normal(
  name: "Accept Bridge Would Cast",
  types: [Enchantment],
  abilities: [
    Static(CantHappen(Cast(who: Ref(You)))),
  ],
)
